        "Detailed rulings and exceptions depend on your circumstances and school. Ask a reliable Sunni scholar when unsure." to "Batafsil qarorlar va istisnolar sizning sharoitingiz va maktabingizga bog'liq. Ishonchli bo'lmaganda ishonchli sunniy olimdan so'rang.",
